{"h":2857,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.083044982525443012,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"Introduction","y":0.059593022993940092,"w":0.10380622863769531,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017528317039708585,"x":0.084775082816581512,"y":0.10601819486269126,"t":"MARKING THE PRACTICE TESTS","w":0.3373702494303385},{"y":0.14520643810587786,"h":0.019037747900330859,"w":0.20934256235758464,"c":1,"x":0.084775085502291889,"t":"Listening and Reading"},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"y":0.17144856534832831,"t":"The answer keys are on pages 117-124.","w":0.32179931640624998,"x":0.083044978386648149},{"t":"Each question in the Listening and Reading tests is worth one mark.","y":0.18894331667611342,"h":0.017494751574527623,"w":0.53806228637695308,"x":0.08477508509758612,"c":1},{"h":0.018361327863390176,"w":0.47070495605468754,"t":"Questions which require letter \/ Roman numeral answers","y":0.22645486545990778,"x":0.084721448718515072,"c":1},{"y":0.24842547257483694,"x":0.084775090610413273,"w":0.68339101155598958,"t":"For questions where the answers are letters or Roman numerals, you should write only","c":1,"h":0.017562898912156122},{"t":"the number of answers required. For example, if the answer is a single letter or numeral,","y":0.26731980388257437,"w":0.70069203694661464,"h":0.01756391732153828,"c":1,"x":0.083044984835108263},{"x":0.083044976011130034,"w":0.69031143188476562,"c":1,"y":0.2862141356481025,"h":0.017564934396176568,"t":"you should write only one answer. If you have written more letters or numerals than are"},{"c":1,"w":0.36159169514973954,"h":0.018965530929405228,"t":"required, the answer must be marked wrong.","x":0.083044980435510923,"y":0.30370888745525182},{"y":0.34095167312996133,"w":0.54682266235351562,"h":0.018704356306328274,"x":0.08472024509370224,"c":1,"t":"Questions which require answers in the form of words or numbers"},{"y":0.36482558110534857,"w":0.40484428405761719,"t":"• Answers may be written in upper or lower case.","x":0.08131488195000823,"h":0.017609688349751185,"c":1},{"w":0.56920415242513023,"c":1,"x":0.081314878690674705,"t":"• Words in brackets are optional - they are correct, but not necessary.","h":0.017608671275112897,"y":0.38372092994967666},{"y":0.40261627914386255,"w":0.40484428405761713,"x":0.081314882104621844,"t":"• Alternative answers are separated by a slash (\/).","h":0.015988371937820434,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.6453287251790365,"y":0.42005813925289204,"t":"• If you are asked to write an answer using a certain number of words and\/or (a)","h":0.01744186102384615,"x":0.081314876076477943},{"y":0.43895348809035828,"c":1,"t":"number(s), you will be penalised if you exceed this. For example, if a question specities","h":0.01744186102384615,"w":0.69031143188476562,"x":0.10726642930194732},{"x":0.10721244578663326,"w":0.65926600138346358,"t":"an answer using NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS and the correct answer is 'black","y":0.45618925547983058,"c":1,"h":0.018029325737496049},{"t":"leather coat', the answer 'coat of black leather' is incorrect.","w":0.47427642822265614,"h":0.023364324015783589,"x":0.1053903573095801,"y":0.47167530635570387,"c":1},{"y":0.49222705129382516,"t":"• In questions where you are expected to complete a gap, you should only transfer the","w":0.70079386393229171,"h":0.020766762105462577,"x":0.081268567231695107,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.69723180135091145,"t":"necessary missing word(s) onto the answer sheet. For example, to complete 'in the ...,","x":0.10726645864547833,"y":0.51014695604952076,"h":0.018922811125107297},{"y":0.52761627920772514,"c":1,"x":0.10726644118752583,"t":"where the correct answer is 'morning', the answer 'in the morning' would be incorrect.","w":0.68512110392252601,"h":0.020348836526410286},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"w":0.5432526143391927,"y":0.54933519926669772,"x":0.081314869208244059,"t":"• All answers require correct spelling (including words in brackets)."},{"w":0.62975779215494787,"c":1,"y":0.56682995125770241,"x":0.08131487555198845,"t":"• Both US and UK spelling are acceptable and are included in the answer key.","h":0.017494751574527623},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"w":0.6211072794596354,"t":"• All standard alternatives for numbers, dates and currencies are acceptable.","y":0.58572428302308499,"x":0.081314872292663695},{"x":0.081235008200484529,"y":0.60296258086475507,"h":0.017954103591310333,"c":1,"w":0.36349126180013025,"t":"• All standard abbreviations are acceptable."},{"t":"• You will find additional notes about individual answers in the answer key.","c":1,"h":0.020400184113467112,"y":0.61922065131913517,"w":0.60399993896484383,"x":0.081232969483472695},{"w":0.074775218963623033,"h":0.022326484770938348,"y":0.65001355633209901,"c":1,"x":0.083787785512536558,"t":"Writing"},{"h":0.017512043178123271,"t":"The sample answers are on pages 125-139. It is not possible for you to give yourself a","x":0.084775076660279614,"y":0.67877906948553424,"w":0.68166091918945304,"c":1},{"h":0.019231056149311199,"y":0.69590919193986445,"t":"mark for the Writing tasks. We have provided sample answers (written by candidates),","w":0.68176737467447912,"x":0.084730973829248199,"c":1},{"y":0.71375337779607073,"x":0.082991462511937467,"h":0.019007017430598405,"c":1,"t":"showing their score and the examiners' comments. Additional sample and model answers","w":0.71117462158203126},{"t":"can be downloaded from the Resource Bank. These sample and model answers will give","h":0.020454777797007551,"y":0.73114279831168283,"c":1,"x":0.084711760799728406,"w":0.69737538655598952},{"t":"you an insight into what is required for the Writing test.","y":0.75290697681716645,"w":0.44290659586588549,"h":0.016162302378927462,"x":0.083044971868245387,"c":1}]}